  "text": "You put up a million dollars to invest in America. You still can't get a green card. India's EB-5 investor visa allocation just ran out for the entire fiscal year 2026. Indians now file 22% of all EB-5 petitions globally, second only to China. Three green card categories are now closed for Indians. Only EB-3 moved forward, by just two weeks. Families are stuck. Children turning 21 risk aging out of their parents' applications forever. One path stays open. Reserved EB-5 projects in rural and high unemployment areas are still current. A million dollars. A decade of waiting. That is America's immigration system for Indian investors.",
